SgCGA&oe=6B0DCC61"}, {"file_name": "BallonPop_Screenshot.png", "id": "2053609291789381", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391967_2053609295122714_5342321999149614343_n.png?_nc_cat=104&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=4v2qe8mjzoIQ7kNvwGmIMmu&_nc_oc=Adr45W6v20OAgNSrA5Hq2zviysUySP2lGJRMcegFUQHzhPgz1YtLaFAiQ7KAs_K3di0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQRe007Vj9tPU_vVlY3MHN_eSr5q-kIMlYhdA4eVWX6jJQ&oe=6B0DA6F8"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "vArcher", "keywords": ["archery", "bow", "arrow", "archer", "simulator"], "long_description": "A Comprehensive archery range simulation featuring multiple customizable bows, arrows and targets.  Physically accurate parameters let you experience shooting bows from the comfort of home. \n\n**Customizable Arrows:**\n- Choose from a variety of tips, shafts, fletchings and nocks\n- Each part contributes to the total weight and properties of the arrow\n\n**Bows:**\n- English Long Bow\n- Recurve Bow\n- Compound Bow\n- Japanese Yumi\n- Medieval Crossbow\n\n**Tuning and Tweaking**\n- Customize bow parameters like Draw Weight, Draw Length and IBO Speed to match your real bow setup or get a feel for a new one\n- Hone the perfect shot with features like string-walking, multiple string release methods and micro offsets for hand positions\n- Add attachments like stabilizers, sights and more\n- Save and load multiple configurations for each bow\n\n**Ranges and Targets**\n- Includes Indoor and Outdoor ranges with customizable targets and distances\n- Freely place targets in The Sandbox Range for a unique 3D shooting experience\n- Choose from a variety of targets like standard Rounds, tumbling blocks, playing cards, balloons and of course, Apples\n- Get instant shot feedback for Bullseye targets via hit marker displays\n\n**Challenge Ranges**\n- Test your skill in a variety of special challenges and chase high scores", "sh